text.section:
The Director may:

Prepare and submit to the Secretary annual applications for the support of the State Reclamation Program and implementation of specific reclamation projects;


Enter into agreements with the Secretary for the emergency restoration, reclamation, abatement, control, or prevention of the adverse effects of coal mining practices;


Administer the State Reclamation Plan and annual reclamation projects and receive and administer grants from the Secretary therefor; and


Prepare and submit such information and reports as the Secretary requests.
